    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dunes of Raeth\u00a0</strong>is a 1st person Adventure game set in and below the dunes of a war-torn planet. You play as the King of Raeth, a ruler who has had to endure many wars, droughts and coup attempts during his rule. Solve the puzzles put before you by the embodiment of the planet you rule, and dive deeper, closer to the living, beating heart of your world. Decide the future of your kingdom and of the ones you love!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Developed by Kalempirion Studios 13 - </p>",
